ee a very epic fight  scene between the dora melange and a  group of soldiers the group of soldiers  is trying to break in and steal some  vibranium on a ship but the dora milaje  were undercover and they managed to stop  them this pretty much confirms that one  of the main big story plots of wakanda  forever is vibranium and how the world  wants vibranium and possibly even doctor  doom we don't know who the soldiers  belong to they could belong to a  government or they could belong to a  villain we'll have to wait and see on  that one but what they said about the  trailer footage was that this movie  actually looks like it could be better  than the first black panther movie we  then moved on to ironheart and there was  one big reveal here and that is that the  hood is confirmed to be the main villain  of the iron heart series now what we  learned about this project is that it's  going to be about magic and tech so the  two of them colliding so that's probably  going to be pretty interesting to see on  screen it's also confirmed that jim rash  is going to be returning to play his  character from captain america civil war  as the mit guy cracking down on riri  williams's engineering projects of  course we know that she's probably  building an iron heart suit the hood  will deal with dark magic and could  possibly even have agatha harkness  behind him because we do know covent of  chaos is coming relatively soon as well  now the next thing is that we did get a  confirmation for the project werewolf by  knight if you didn't catch the trailer  we'll be talking about it soon but it is  very very old school very frankenstein  vibes and honestly it looks really  really creepy so for those halloween  fans out there and those kind of horror  type fans out there this is going to be  a pretty cool one it is a one-off little  special that they're doing so right now  we are actually kind of unsure if  werewolf by night will be officially  joining the mcu and staying in the mcu  